//RS // The table owns only row and view state.  It emits no markup or styles.  The
//RS // row type stays generic, while the checked compiler supplies the column
//RS // accessor and cell type.  Runtime sorting/filtering is deliberately stable
//RS // and deterministic so every renderer sees the same page.
